# Keep the deployment to what the runtime actually needs. Without this the
# package carries the whole devDependency tree — azurite alone is ~250 packages —
# plus every test and coverage artifact.
.git*
.vscode
__azurite*
__blobstorage__
coverage/
node_modules/.cache
src/
test/
*.md
*.log
eslint.config.js
tsconfig*.json
vitest*.config.ts
